second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is \\\"I Love New York\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 53, \"text\": \"text at the bottom encouraged people to \\\"Be generous.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d00\", \"start\": 54, \"end\": 74, \"text\": \"Your city needs you.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d00\", \"start\": 75, \"end\": 104, \"text\": \"This poster is not for sale.\\\"\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d00\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 208, \"text\": \"\\\"I Love New York\\\" was written and composed by Steve Karmen in 1977 as part of the advertising campaign.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d00\", \"start\": 209, \"end\": 277, \"text\": \"In 1980, Governor Hugh Carey declared it as New York's state anthem.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d00\", \"start\": 278, \"end\": 441, \"text\": \"In a move that was remarkable for Karmen, who is well known for retaining the publishing rights to his songs, he gave the rights to the song to the state for free.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d00\", \"start\": 442, \"end\": 532, \"text\": \"The logo has become a pop-culture icon, inspiring imitations in every corner of the globe.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d00\", \"start\": 533, \"end\": 559, \"text\": \"Merchandise proclaiming \\\"I\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 213, \"text\": \"\\\"New York Goes to Hollywood\\\".) In addition to Pollard, a host of other individuals from \\\"Flavor of Love\\\", including \\\"Sister\\\" Patterson (Pollard's mother), appeared on the show to help Pollard choose the right man.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d01\", \"start\": 214, \"end\": 293, \"text\": \"Mauricio Sanchez played New York's assistant, \\\"Chamo,\\\" during the first season.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d01\", \"start\": 294, \"end\": 433, \"text\": \"The production of a second season of \\\"I Love New York\\\" was first announced during a commercial break for the April 29, 2007, episode of \\\"\\\".\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d01\", \"start\": 434, \"end\": 558, \"text\": \"After the show was wrapped up for season one, the house was used for another VH1 show, \\\"Flavor of Love Girls: Charm School\\\".\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d01\", \"start\": 559, \"end\": 593, \"text\": \"A large number of contestants from\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 30, \"text\": \"her character with conviction.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d02\", \"start\": 31, \"end\": 202, \"text\": \"\\\"Filmfare\\\" reviewer Rachit Gupta gave the film 3 out of 5 stars criticising the film's \\\"mish-mash of sentimentality, annoying characters and clichéd rom com developments\\\".\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d02\", \"start\": 203, \"end\": 326, \"text\": \"Gupta also felt that Deol and Ranaut as a pair was a miscast, with Deol particularly not gelling as a romantic comedy lead.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d02\", \"start\": 327, \"end\": 371, \"text\": \"He also felt that the music was forgettable.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d02\", \"start\": 372, \"end\": 506, \"text\": \"However Gupta did praise Ranaut who he commented was the highlight of the film as \\\"She's quite literally too good to be in this film\\\".\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d02\", \"start\": 507, \"end\": 583, \"text\": \"The film collected nett in its entire theatrical run against the budget of .\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0433-e1103d5dac41:d02\", \"start\": 584, \"end\": 587, \"text\": \"The\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"state anthem\", \"advertising campaign\", \"pop-culture icon\", \"logo\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"state anthem\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"advertising campaign\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"pop-culture icon\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"logo\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C4\", \"answer\": \"song written by Steve Karmen\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C5\", \"answer\": \"television show\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C6\", \"answer\": \"rights given to the state for free\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C7\", \"answer\": \"declared state anthem in 1980\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C8\", \"answer\": \"inspired global imitations\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C9\", \"answer\": \"part of 1977 advertising campaign\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C10\", \"answer\": \"Steve Karmen retained publishing rights generally\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C11\", \"answer\": \"second season announced in 2007\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C12\", \"answer\": \"used for Flavor of Love Girls: Charm School\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C13\", \"answer\": \"hosted by individuals from Flavor of